# Verification (every phase, every chat)

Read `docs/verification/AGENT-PROTOCOL.md` when starting or finishing phase work.

## Before marking phase done

1. Run `npm run verify:phase-<N>` from project root
2. If exit code ≠ 0 → fix → re-run until **0**
3. Results append to `docs/verification/agent-log.md` automatically
4. Update `PROJECT.md` Section 19 only after verify passes
5. Give user `docs/verification/phase-<N>-checklist.md` for manual steps

## New chat

User says **Phase N** only → read Section 19 + Section 16 + agent-log + AGENT-PROTOCOL → **tell user any missing skills to install for Phase N** → then implement.

Never skip verify because a prior chat already ran it — re-run after meaningful changes.

Never read or log `.env.local` secrets.
